---
---

<section id="about" class="text-silver-100 py-28 md:py-40 relative overflow-hidden border-t border-line/40">
  <div
    class="absolute inset-0 opacity-50 pointer-events-none"
    style="background:
      radial-gradient(50% 50% at 80% 100%, rgba(192, 197, 204, 0.15) 0%, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) 60%),
      radial-gradient(40% 40% at 10% 0%, rgba(110, 168, 255, 0.10) 0%, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) 60%);"
  ></div>

  <div class="relative max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 grid md:grid-cols-12 gap-10 md:gap-20">
    <div class="md:col-span-5">
      <div class="text-[12px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-silver-400 mb-5">
        Who we are
      </div>
      <h2 class="font-display display-tight text-5xl md:text-7xl">
        <span class="text-white">Local.</span>
        <br />
        <span class="silver-text">Honest.</span>
        <br />
        <span class="text-silver-500">Built for it.</span>
      </h2>
    </div>
    <div class="md:col-span-7 space-y-6 text-silver-200 text-xl leading-relaxed">
      <p>
        A local business shouldn't need a Melbourne agency to have a good website,
        a tidy Instagram, or a catalogue worth handing to a customer.
      </p>
      <p>
        We work with cafés, boutiques, makers, tradies and wineries in and around
        Ballarat. We meet in person. We answer the phone. We charge fixed prices
        so you know what things cost before they happen.
      </p>
      <div class="hairline-silver my-10 opacity-50"></div>
      <p class="text-silver-400 text-base">
        We're new — and transparent about it. Which means hungry, honest about scope, and allergic to padding invoices.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
